OL,3,GNEWSAMother with disabled son fears
OL,4,Arise in intolerance
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Adults have whispered about him,
OL,7,Fgossiping and judging him, and there
OL,8,Fhave been young children calling him
OL,9,Fthe most disgusting names," she
OL,10,Fexplained.
